 "<h2>Where do Estero kitchens cluster?</h2>"
 "<p>Much of the village's food service sits along the U.S. 41 and Coconut Road / Coconut Point area, around Corkscrew Road near I-75, and in shopping and hotel clusters that serve visitors heading to the Gulf or to Florida Gulf Coast University. Season is real here: winter weeks are busier than late summer. Pump before a due date falls in the middle of a packed stretch if you can. We do not name private restaurants as clients on this page. For a wider list of cities, use the <a href='/grease-trap-pumping-service-areas/'>grease service-areas hub</a>.</p>"
