 "<li><a href='/grease-trap-pumping-alva-fl/'><strong>Alva</strong></a> — State Road 80 and the Caloosahatchee. Many rural sites are on septic with outdoor interceptors.</li>"
 "<li><a href='/grease-trap-pumping-buckingham-fl/'><strong>Buckingham</strong></a> — Large lots east of Fort Myers. Many kitchens are on septic; LCU accounts follow Ordinance 14-24.</li>"
 "</ul>"
 "<h2>Collier County area cities</h2>"
 "<ul class='cards'>"
 "<li><a href='/grease-trap-pumping-naples-fl/'><strong>Naples</strong></a> — Fifth Avenue South, Third Street South, and U.S. 41. City sewer and Collier County sewer are different programs; confirm the utility.</li>"
 "<li><a href='/grease-trap-pumping-north-naples-fl/'><strong>North Naples</strong></a> — Immokalee Road, Vanderbilt Beach, and Tamiami Trail North. County sewer customers follow Collier's published 30-day trap and 90-day interceptor intervals.</li>"
 "<li><a href='/grease-trap-pumping-marco-island-fl/'><strong>Marco Island</strong></a> — Collier Boulevard and Bald Eagle Drive. Confirm the current City Water &amp; Sewer grease schedule.</li>"
 "<li><a href='/grease-trap-pumping-golden-gate-estates-fl/'><strong>Golden Gate Estates</strong></a> — Immokalee Road and the rural grid. Many lots are on septic; county-sewer customers follow Collier's 30/90-day program.</li>"
 "<li><a href='/grease-trap-pumping-ave-maria-fl/'><strong>Ave Maria</strong></a> — Town center and Pope John Paul II Boulevard. Confirm the current Ave Maria Utility Company schedule.</li>"
 "<li><a href='/grease-trap-pumping-immokalee-fl/'><strong>Immokalee</strong></a> — Main Street and Immokalee Road. Confirm Immokalee Water &amp; Sewer District's current grease schedule.</li>"
