 "Septic filter cleaning in North Fort Myers, FL",
 "<p><strong>North of the Caloosahatchee, many neighborhoods and rural properties still depend on a septic tank, and the effluent filter on that tank is one of the easiest things to overlook until a drain backs up.</strong> This page is for homeowners in North Fort Myers, including along Business 41, Hancock Bridge Parkway, and Pine Island Road, whose wastewater is still treated on the lot. We clean the filter at no charge during a pump-out and can show you how to keep it clear. Call <a href='tel:"+TEL+"'>"+PHONE+"</a> or <a href='"+BOOK+"' rel='noopener' target='_blank'>request a North Fort Myers visit on ServiceM8</a>.</p>"
