 "<h2>This is not the City of Fort Myers page</h2>"
 "<p>Houses south of the river, or inside city utilities, should start at <a href='/septic-filter-cleaning-fort-myers-fl/'>filter cleaning in Fort Myers</a> and confirm the sewer bill. Cape Coral has its own remaining-septic story. General method is on <a href='/septic-filter-care/'>septic filter care</a>. The full list is on the <a href='/septic-filter-cleaning-service-areas/'>filter service-areas hub</a>.</p>"
 "<h2>Business 41 and Hancock Bridge are commuter routes, not a reason to skip the filter</h2>"
