 ("Does a Punta Gorda address automatically have an effluent filter?","No. Punta Gorda is the county seat, and some addresses are on city utilities. This page is only for homes in and around Punta Gorda that still use a septic tank. We will tell you if that tank has an outlet filter when we open it. Call (239) 451-3261."),
 ("Do you clean the filter when you pump a Punta Gorda-area tank?","Yes, when one is present. That work is included in the pump-out, and we can show you how the filter seats so a later check is straightforward."),
