 "<h2>What to ask, even when the company is local</h2>"
 "<p>Being based in Estero does not replace a direct question: will you empty the outlet as well as the inlet, and will you clean the filter if one is there? We do both, and the filter cleaning is included in the pump-out. For a standard 1 to 3 bedroom tank, residential pumping starts at $399.99; we confirm it for your tank by phone. If a backup is already happening after hours, pumping is $599.99, and that should be requested by phone rather than the form. The overview list is on the <a href='/why-we-pump-both-tanks-service-areas/'>why we pump both tanks hub</a>. Nearby Bonita and San Carlos Park have their own pages if that is actually where the house sits. Filter details, separate from this compartment question, are on <a href='/septic-filter-cleaning-estero-fl/'>filter cleaning in Estero</a>.</p>"
