 "<p>Ask whether the outlet will be emptied with the inlet, and whether a filter will be cleaned if one is there. We do that filter work as part of the pump-out and can show you how it seats. Residential pumping for a standard 1 to 3 bedroom tank starts at $399.99, confirmed when you call. If you already have a backup after hours, pumping is $599.99; call rather than using the form. The city list is on the <a href='/why-we-pump-both-tanks-service-areas/'>why we pump both tanks hub</a>. Filter-specific beach notes are on <a href='/septic-filter-cleaning-fort-myers-beach-fl/'>filter cleaning on Fort Myers Beach</a>.</p>"
